====== devolo WiFi pro 1200e ======

The devolo WiFi pro 1200e is a wall mountable access point with:

  * Dual band 2.4 and 5 GHz WiFi (2 × 2 IEEE 802.11ac 866Mbps, 2 × 2 IEEE 802.11n 300Mbps)
  * 2x 1Gbit ethernet ports (with Power over Ethernet support)
  * Kensington Lock


